,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But while he was still alive, Abraham gave gifts to the sons of his concubines and sent them away from his son Isaac to the land of the east.","from":8},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard.","from":3},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard.","from":6},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":38,"verseEnd":38,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Benjamin by their clans: The Belaite clan from Bela, the Ashbelite clan from Ashbel, the Ahiramite clan from Ahiram,","from":1},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":39,"verseEnd":39,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the Shuphamite clan from Shupham, and the Huphamite clan from Hupham.","from":5},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":40,"verseEnd":40,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the descendants of Bela from Ard and Naaman were the Ardite clan from Ard and the Naamite clan from Naaman.","from":3},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":42,"verseEnd":42,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Shaalabbin, Aijalon, Ithlah,","from":13}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"14-28":{"people":[{"id":"shashak-h8349","name":"Shashak","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":2,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"ahio-h0283h","name":"Ahio","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"jeremoth-h3406i","name":"Jeremoth","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"arad-h6166b","name":"Arad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"eder-h5738","name":"Eder","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"zebadiah-h2069g","name":"Zebadiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"