:0,"source":"tsk","text":"The Benjamites, however, failed to drive out the Jebusites living in Jerusalem. So to this day the Jebusites live there among the Benjamites.","from":28},{"book":"1CH","chapter":8,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and Beriah and Shema (who were the heads of families living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath).","from":16},{"book":"1CH","chapter":8,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and Beriah and Shema (who were the heads of families living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath).","from":21},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":34,"verseEnd":34,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"All these were heads of Levite families, chiefs according to their genealogies, and they lived in Jerusalem.","from":28},{"book":"NEH","chapter":11,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now the leaders of the people settled in Jerusalem, and the rest of the people cast lots to bring one out of ten to live in the holy city of Jerusalem, while the remaining nine were to dwell in their own towns.","from":28},{"book":"NEH","chapter":11,"verse":7,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the descendants of Benjamin: Sallu son of Meshullam, the son of Joed, the son of Pedaiah, the son of Kolaiah, the son of Maaseiah, the son of Ithiel, the son of Jeshaiah; and his followers Gabbai and Sallai—928 men. Joel son of Zichri was the officer over them, and Judah son of Hassenuah was over the Second District of the city.","from":28}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"29-40":{"people":[{"id":"abiel-h0022g","name":"Abiel","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":2,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"maacah-h4601n","name":"Maacah","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"kish-h7027g","name":"Kish","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's father","count":2,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"abdon-h5658j","name":"Abdon","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":30},